t the catholic church  number one to hear his voice a lot of  people  haven't heard that and he's never been  one of the first television interviewers  yeah  most people have not heard him speak  before but he certainly is not one to  mince words charlie i'm surprised he  came out  there's a lot more in this in terms of  how he wants to go to war against  republican leadership in the congress  and we will share how he views himself  and his plan to defend president trump  outside the white house  in the next hour half hour you can see  our full interview this  sunday evening at 7 6 central on 60  minutes  right here on cbs
 

